# krun: pick workloads on any cluster, then run a command in all their pods
Output docs/krun.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "krun"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "nginx"
Sleep 1500ms
Space
Sleep 700ms
Space
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "nginx -s reload"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "y"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
